      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expected Webhook Input\n\n```json\nPOST /webhook/ollama_tailscale_call\n\n{\n  \"query\": \"Your question here\",\n  \"systemPrompt\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\",\n  \"model\": \"qwen2.5:7b-instruct\"\n}\n```\n\n### Fields:\n- **query** (required): The user's question\n- **systemPrompt** (optional): Sent straight through to Ollama. Default: \"You are a helpful assistant.\"\n- **model** (optional): Ollama model tag. Default: \"qwen2.5:7b-instruct\"\n\nNo lookups, no external data source — this subflow is a direct passthrough to Ollama.\n\n### Backend\nOllama running on `spark-ddaa.tail0d52ba.ts.net:11434` (Tailscale), called via its OpenAI-compatible `/v1/chat/completions` endpoint.\n\n### Available Models:\nAny model tag pulled on that Ollama host, e.g.:\n- qwen2.5:7b-instruct\n- llama3.2:3b",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 650
      }
